# CI vs CD

CI/CD is a DevOps practice that automates the process of integrating, testing, delivering, and deploying software.

---

## CI — Continuous Integration

Continuous Integration is the practice of frequently merging code changes into a shared repository and automatically validating those changes.

### CI Process

```text
Developer
    ↓
Git Push
    ↓
Source Code Repository
    ↓
Build
    ↓
Automated Tests
    ↓
Code Quality Checks
    ↓
Security Checks
